Separating a column - Example


Code
cru_tmp |&gt;
  separate(
    # Column to separate
    MonthYear,
    # New columns. Provided as text
    c("Month","Year"),
    # Separator
    sep="-",
    # Don't remove
    remove=FALSE
  )


